# Guru Pathik's trigger is for spells its controller casts: Bot2 casting Firebending Lesson (a Lesson) on turn 2, on Guru Pathik, puts
# no counter on Bot1's Ornithopter (still 0/2) and Guru Pathik survives the 2 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Guru Pathik
Ornithopter
Island x3
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Firebending Lesson
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
